          "description": [
            {
              "text": "At the opening instant, the entire supplied showroom image remains intact, with the black sports car positioned on the empty floor and the surrounding space holding its full composition."
            },
            {
              "text": " The car sits low and broad, its carbon-fibre body dark against the pale showroom surface, while the deeper background stays in shadow."
            },
            {
              "text": " As the shot begins, the car eases forward from that shadowed depth, its movement slow and deliberate, and the darkness behind it gradually recedes as more of the floor becomes visible."
            },
            {
              "text": " The front of the car crosses into the light first, and a moving highlight travels along the long carbon-fibre panels, tracing the edge of the hood, the curve of the fender and the shallow slope of the roof."
            },
            {
              "text": " The pale floor beneath the car carries a soft, stretching reflection that changes shape with the advance, and the car's shadow shortens and slides backward as the light reaches further across the body."
            },
            {
              "text": " The wheels turn with a measured, heavy rhythm, and the low stance keeps the car close to the ground as it moves clear of the darkest area."
            },
            {
              "text": " The empty showroom remains quiet around it, with the foreground floor smooth and open, the car centered in the available space, and no other object interrupting the path ahead."
            },
            {
              "text": " The forward glide continues without a sudden burst; the car maintains a steady, controlled pace, letting the shift from shadow to light read clearly across the bodywork."
            },
            {
              "text": " By the end of the shot, the car has moved forward enough to sit in the brighter part of the showroom, while the rear of the body is still touched by the fading darkness behind it."
            },
            {
              "text": " The carbon-fibre surface holds a cool, glassy sheen, and the contrast between the dark body and the pale floor grows sharper as the car advances."
