e opening instant: the black sports car rests on the empty floor with the shadowed background behind it. At 00:00.000, The car eases forward from the dark toward the light at a slow, deliberate pace. At 00:00.000, A low engine hum and soft tyre roll begin as the car moves. At 00:01.200, The front body enters the brighter area, and a highlight moves along the carbon-fibre panels. At 00:03.500, The car continues forward, now mostly in the brighter part of the showroom, while the rear remains touched by shadow. The camera holds a static shot. Throughout the target video: Do not add spoken or sung lines.\n\noverall_soundscape: A low engine hum and soft tyre roll carry across the empty showroom floor, with a faint room tone beneath them.\n\nnon_diegetic_music: N/A\n",
